  "reason": "At anchor 100, first-per-value keeps tag ab at time 10, ignores its later duplicate at time 20, and keeps ba at time 30. Time 110 is after the anchor at 100 and is excluded; cutoff equality remains eligible. The supplied BPE has no merges, so ab emits a,b and ba emits b,a. Final roles pad=0, unknown=1 and missing=2 precede private country US=3 and text a=4,b=5. Field-major order therefore emits [4,5,5,4,3]. Explicit ages repeat per retained text piece: [90,90,70,70], followed by an invalid static-country age. User 2 has only its country token, no dated occurrences; all its age slots are invalid. No automatic timestamp or elapsed-time feature is requested.",
